6136-2020-ER-F0001 P1 1 p123 The overall performance of the candidates was not satisfactory. This is because most candidates could not interpret terminologies used and had difficulties in mastering the subject content. Most candidates could not comprehend the relevance of the sources and instead used their own understanding on the question without referring to the source as the question required.
6136-2020-ER-F0002 P1 1 p123 also be given to the levels of learning, e.g. teaching candidates how to answer questions that require them to describe, explain, etc. It was observed that candidates do not read instructions, they could not start each question on a separate page and they wrote between margins which made it impossible for the markers to indicate marks.
